{"3291010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAW Patrol™ Rescue Wheels™: Championship", "steam_appid": 3291010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/d7d753d42044bdf15a17834c1dac1ee3.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>The Rescue Wheels crew is here, and they’re revved up! Race with Chase, Skye, Marshall, Rubble, Zuma, Rocky, and Roxi. Wreak havoc with Boomer &amp; Frank. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/30551d7463dad818d85e995e7587dd32.poster.avif?t=1761920798\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/30551d7463dad818d85e995e7587dd32.webm?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/30551d7463dad818d85e995e7587dd32.mp4?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Destroy the tracks with Mayor Humdinger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/165bc6d1da7b30a4f7f2cd051608d999.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>Get ahead of the competition by collecting Pup Treats and objects<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/05dad8326bec11fbc15c486cb8c75ce5.poster.avif?t=1761920798\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/05dad8326bec11fbc15c486cb8c75ce5.webm?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/05dad8326bec11fbc15c486cb8c75ce5.mp4?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Choose your ultimate Pup Racer, each with a unique skill to unleash on the tracks. Launch tennis balls with Chase, send racers spinning with Skye or leave them stuck in the mud with Zuma. Pull out all the stops to throw off your competition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/182427b1f310521e0fad74995e0d1ec0.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>With different game modes and difficulty levels, everyone has a chance to become a Monster Truck champion! Master drifts, turbo boosts, and epic signature stunts to rule the dirt roads. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/74acc263cb31365e30d4d5891e5daffa.poster.avif?t=1761920798\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/74acc263cb31365e30d4d5891e5daffa.webm?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/74acc263cb31365e30d4d5891e5daffa.mp4?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bulldozer, Hovercraft, Jet. Which one will you choose to help you win the championship?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/cd593f6ce2e6a3173a9c0de06e8a0c2f.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>Claim victory solo dodging pies and confetti or challenge your friends in multiplayer to wow fans in the stands. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7aa040943e5557417db9bd3df6e9964f.poster.avif?t=1761920798\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7aa040943e5557417db9bd3df6e9964f.webm?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7aa040943e5557417db9bd3df6e9964f.mp4?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Speed through arenas across Adventure Bay, the Jungle, Foggy Bottom, and beyond in multiplayer<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/05e4b5d652b20bf3fd174264c7e79d7d.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>Grab your best Pup Pals and let’s Rox and roll! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7061d7d07a4d2734547b56d32d1423fb.poster.avif?t=1761920798\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7061d7d07a4d2734547b56d32d1423fb.webm?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/7061d7d07a4d2734547b56d32d1423fb.mp4?t=1761920798\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Perform tricks mid-air to get a boost and unlock your Pup’s signature stunt.<br><br>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291010/extras/d7d753d42044bdf15a17834c1dac1ee3.avif?t=1761920798\" width=615 height=125 /></span><br>The Rescue Wheels crew is here, and they’re revved up! Race with Chase, Skye, Marshall, Rubble, Zuma, Rocky, and Roxi. Wreak havoc with Boom